  SHORTCUTS
  ────────────────────────────────────────

  n / Enter / Space     Another saying
  l / →                 Next language or variant
  h / ←                 Previous language or variant
  c                     Next category
  o                     Open the source
  ?                     Close this help
  q / Esc               Quit




  n next · o open · l/h language · c category · ? help · q quit
